WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.191 --> 01:44.094
=Episode 21=

01:55.144 --> 01:55.704
Mr. Gao,

01:56.023 --> 01:58.463
the sales department
has received massive return requests.

01:58.663 --> 02:00.303
Orders are also being canceled.

02:00.864 --> 02:02.424
And there are more reporters outside.

02:02.743 --> 02:04.504
Shouldn't we
contact a PR firm immediately

02:04.504 --> 02:05.784
for a crisis management plan?

02:06.584 --> 02:09.823
We'll soon hold the meeting
to discuss expanding sales channels.

02:10.383 --> 02:11.784
And now this...

02:16.024 --> 02:16.983
Notify all departments.

02:17.504 --> 02:19.263
Do not issue
any public statements for now.

02:20.024 --> 02:25.624
Also, have the quality inspectors
test sanitary pads across all regions.

02:26.344 --> 02:27.904
Okay, I'll arrange it right away.

02:28.583 --> 02:29.263
Mr. Gao,

02:29.944 --> 02:31.983
I heard the board approached you.

02:33.064 --> 02:35.263
What did Mr. Li say?

02:36.184 --> 02:37.383
He must support you, right?

02:37.863 --> 02:40.383
Besides, he's a senior board member
with considerable influence.

02:45.703 --> 02:48.624
Guess who recommended the new member?

03:08.712 --> 03:09.543
(Letao Tower)

03:09.543 --> 03:11.624
The Her Series is
currently under intense scrutiny.

03:11.784 --> 03:13.744
We can't predict
how public opinion will shift.

03:13.983 --> 03:16.143
So I suggest
halting the new product expansion.

03:16.344 --> 03:17.103
No further action.

03:17.663 --> 03:18.383
Yes.

03:18.464 --> 03:21.583
Also, the board has always been hesitant
about our production line setup.

03:21.983 --> 03:25.383
Given the current situation,
they won't support the product upgrade.

03:26.024 --> 03:28.064
I've completed the upgrade plan
for the new product.

03:28.344 --> 03:31.064
Shall we pause or proceed?
I'll support whichever decision is made.

03:34.383 --> 03:36.904
We'll proceed
with the product upgrade as planned.

03:37.103 --> 03:38.103
But the public opinion?

03:38.423 --> 03:39.624
There are pros and cons.

03:40.143 --> 03:42.344
Quitting now would be unwise,
giving others something

03:42.784 --> 03:43.784
against us.

03:51.344 --> 03:51.983
Huan'er.

03:52.263 --> 03:53.383
Dr. Wei, please sit.

03:53.383 --> 03:55.863
I've tested the sanitary pads overnight.

03:56.103 --> 03:56.840
Here's the report.

03:57.143 --> 03:58.663
Over ten packages are substandard.

04:01.032 --> 04:03.016
(The Her Series Test Report)

04:04.744 --> 04:07.263
It appears someone is
deliberately sabotaging the Her Series

04:07.624 --> 04:09.784
to manipulate public perception
of the Her Series.

04:10.184 --> 04:11.383
Can we identify the culprit?

04:12.504 --> 04:13.344
It's highly possible.

04:13.863 --> 04:15.784
But I need more concrete evidence.

04:16.343 --> 04:17.064
Alright, Dr. Wei.

04:17.064 --> 04:18.263
You may go home and rest.

04:18.624 --> 04:20.783
I'll investigate the source
of the defective products.

04:20.864 --> 04:22.064
I'll keep you updated on this.

04:22.304 --> 04:23.064
Okay, no problem.

04:23.463 --> 04:24.023
Thank you.

05:11.703 --> 05:12.383
It's done?

05:12.864 --> 05:13.664
I'm moving it.

05:13.664 --> 05:14.263
Okay.

05:23.823 --> 05:25.744
Guys, destroy this batch immediately!

05:25.744 --> 05:26.583
Or no bonuses.

05:26.583 --> 05:27.383
Come on!

05:27.624 --> 05:28.064
Okay.

05:33.064 --> 05:34.143
Come on!

05:39.504 --> 05:40.783
Hey, what are you doing here?

05:43.023 --> 05:43.984
I'm a Letao employee.

05:43.984 --> 05:44.944
I'm here for the goods.

05:45.493 --> 05:46.143
You took photos.

05:46.143 --> 05:46.744
Delete them.

05:46.823 --> 05:47.903
What's it to you?

05:47.912 --> 05:49.463
You can leave, but leave the camera.

05:50.463 --> 05:51.944
You have no right to take my camera.

05:52.624 --> 05:53.544
Leave the camera!

05:54.463 --> 05:55.143
Leave the camera.

05:55.143 --> 05:56.168
- I'm calling the police!
- Give me!

05:56.263 --> 05:57.064
Give me the camera!

05:57.944 --> 05:58.463
Give me!

05:58.463 --> 05:59.223
Stop!

06:01.304 --> 06:01.903
Are you okay?

06:02.143 --> 06:02.744
Police!

06:03.104 --> 06:03.664
I'm fine.

06:04.864 --> 06:05.304
What?

06:05.424 --> 06:06.544
Freeze! Arrest them!

06:12.104 --> 06:12.703
Your name?

06:13.263 --> 06:14.703
I'm Lin Huan'er.

06:15.104 --> 06:15.823
Lin Huan'er.

06:18.383 --> 06:19.064
Mr. Li.

06:19.504 --> 06:22.583
I've located the warehouse
for counterfeit Her Series.

06:22.903 --> 06:23.583
Good.

06:24.263 --> 06:26.903
Letao's crisis is now resolved.

06:29.304 --> 06:31.184
A foreign partnership
isn't a good solution.

06:31.184 --> 06:33.064
I know your doubt
about independent research.

06:33.304 --> 06:35.463
But you can't do bad things, right?

06:36.583 --> 06:39.583
Counterfeit goods
don't just damage Letao's reputation.

06:40.463 --> 06:42.383
If these bad products flood the market,

06:43.263 --> 06:44.783
it'll risk consumers' health.

06:46.544 --> 06:49.223
Haiming, what are you implying?

06:50.143 --> 06:51.984
You might want to check
with your assistant.

06:52.304 --> 06:55.544
Luo should've taken him
to the police station.

06:55.544 --> 06:56.783
Gao Haiming, you...

06:57.624 --> 06:58.263
Correct.

06:59.903 --> 07:01.783
This is the interrogation transcript.

07:02.023 --> 07:02.783
Please review it.

07:02.944 --> 07:04.664
Sign it if you have no questions.

07:05.304 --> 07:05.944
Thank you.

07:07.823 --> 07:08.624
Done.

07:08.783 --> 07:09.304
It's okay.

07:09.583 --> 07:10.864
She was probably frightened.

07:11.104 --> 07:11.984
You'd better calm her.

07:11.984 --> 07:12.424
Okay.

07:12.583 --> 07:13.664
Okay, goodbye.

07:19.383 --> 07:20.143
I'll take you back.

07:22.583 --> 07:23.184
Okay.

07:27.304 --> 07:29.544
Mr. Gao, I have a request.

07:30.383 --> 07:31.023
Go ahead.

07:32.223 --> 07:35.583
The supermarket suppliers were deceived.

07:36.184 --> 07:37.544
They're all small business owners.

07:37.823 --> 07:41.583
So, could Letao possibly
cover part of the suppliers' losses

07:41.944 --> 07:44.343
by replacing the counterfeit products
with genuine ones?

07:45.104 --> 07:46.023
This way,

07:46.023 --> 07:48.143
we can help other victims like them.

07:48.583 --> 07:51.383
What's more,
it's a great chance to promote Letao.

07:51.823 --> 07:53.984
It'll rebuild distributors' trust in us

07:54.064 --> 07:55.624
and restore our brand reputation.

07:56.392 --> 07:57.832
The sales department is handling it.

07:59.023 --> 08:00.504
So you've already considered this.

08:02.143 --> 08:02.903
And then,

08:02.903 --> 08:05.104
do you have any ideas
of eliminating consumer bias

08:05.104 --> 08:05.903
against Letao?

08:08.544 --> 08:09.383
I think

08:09.744 --> 08:14.544
we could invite industry experts
to endorse the Her Series.

08:15.184 --> 08:18.583
We could also have influential women
review the Her Series.

08:19.424 --> 08:23.583
Use print and online media
to amplify positive word-of-mouth.

08:24.624 --> 08:25.823
But I think

08:26.783 --> 08:28.583
product quality remains most critical.

08:29.143 --> 08:31.304
So I suggest product iteration.

08:31.583 --> 08:32.983
We should launch the Her Series two

08:33.304 --> 08:34.664
to retake our market position.

08:36.304 --> 08:36.944
Good idea.

08:38.144 --> 08:40.784
I'll gather the marketing team
tomorrow morning.

08:40.863 --> 08:41.664
Join us.

08:44.144 --> 08:44.743
Let's go.

09:09.743 --> 09:10.784
You've beaten me.

09:14.944 --> 09:15.503
Mr. Li.

09:16.503 --> 09:17.623
You haven't lost to me.

09:18.944 --> 09:20.784
But you mustn't do such things.

09:22.024 --> 09:25.384
The company might not pursue it,
but do you understand the consequences?

09:27.623 --> 09:28.784
I take responsibility

09:29.944 --> 09:31.384
for my own actions.

09:34.583 --> 09:35.264
But

09:36.024 --> 09:38.664
I genuinely don't want Letao
to take the risk.

09:40.743 --> 09:41.503
I understand.

09:42.463 --> 09:45.544
I know you and the Chairman
built Letao from scratch.

09:46.544 --> 09:48.743
I know how much Letao means to you.

09:49.823 --> 09:51.784
But we're in a new era now.

09:52.343 --> 09:54.743
Long-term growth
depends on our own efforts.

09:56.343 --> 09:59.064
Long-term thinking isn't unrealistic.

10:00.983 --> 10:03.623
But I've seen too many failures.

10:04.103 --> 10:06.463
That's why I resist risks for Letao.

10:08.304 --> 10:10.384
You have excellent patents

10:10.904 --> 10:11.944
and quality products.

10:12.503 --> 10:16.343
But markets and people change rapidly.

10:16.983 --> 10:17.583
Mr. Li.

10:19.024 --> 10:20.103
Please review this.

10:22.463 --> 10:23.863
It's my next-phase plan.

10:24.623 --> 10:25.503
Read it, please.

10:26.312 --> 10:28.030
(Patent Disclosure
and Development Plan of Letao)

10:33.128 --> 10:36.380
(Patent Disclosure
and Development Plan of Letao)

10:40.904 --> 10:42.223
Haiming, you know what?

10:42.784 --> 10:45.064
Once you publish the patent,

10:45.904 --> 10:48.823
how much will Letao lose?

10:50.544 --> 10:52.944
But it'll raise standards
across the entire industry

10:53.223 --> 10:54.424
and lead domestic innovation.

10:55.264 --> 10:57.024
I believe this is inevitable.

10:58.304 --> 10:59.264
I'm confident

10:59.384 --> 11:02.144
that I can keep Letao
at the industry forefront.

11:03.304 --> 11:04.144
Please trust me.

11:09.544 --> 11:12.040
(Patent Disclosure
and Development Plan of Letao)

11:13.944 --> 11:14.944
Haiming.

11:16.944 --> 11:21.463
You've outdistanced my vision.

11:22.223 --> 11:22.743
Actually,

11:23.384 --> 11:24.823
you're more proactive than me.

11:26.384 --> 11:30.064
I always thought
you were being impulsive,

11:30.424 --> 11:31.424
just seeking recognition.

11:33.424 --> 11:34.424
Now I finally understand.

11:37.703 --> 11:38.863
I was wrong.

11:41.223 --> 11:43.024
Terribly wrong.

11:44.463 --> 11:45.184
Mr. Li.

11:54.024 --> 11:54.703
Mr. Li.

11:57.184 --> 11:59.384
Letao and I await your return.

12:45.463 --> 12:48.544
Mr. Gao,
I'll coordinate with marketing later.

12:48.544 --> 12:51.064
They'll expedite the Gen 2 proposal.

12:52.503 --> 12:53.544
R&amp;D department...

12:53.544 --> 12:55.983
I'll email the meeting minutes
to Dr. Wei shortly

12:56.103 --> 12:59.184
to help them
grasp the Gen 2 product concept

12:59.184 --> 13:00.223
and commence immediately.

13:21.623 --> 13:23.463
Mr. Gao, your favorite Americano.

13:25.863 --> 13:26.424
Thank you.

13:36.424 --> 13:36.983
Come in.

13:41.664 --> 13:42.623
Got some supper for you.

13:43.503 --> 13:44.343
You're still here.

13:44.904 --> 13:45.944
I was doing my work

13:46.343 --> 13:47.424
until now.

13:48.103 --> 13:48.983
I saw your light on.

13:48.983 --> 13:50.384
I guessed you'd be hungry.

13:50.863 --> 13:52.103
So I bought it for you.

13:56.623 --> 13:58.223
This wonton soup is good.

13:58.944 --> 14:00.983
I often eat it with a friend.

14:01.384 --> 14:02.424
It tastes great.

14:05.223 --> 14:06.583
If you have time,

14:07.144 --> 14:08.583
we could go to the shop together.

14:09.784 --> 14:10.424
Thank you.

14:15.103 --> 14:15.944
Please, try some.

14:17.103 --> 14:18.376
It might...

14:19.816 --> 14:21.784
It might taste different to you.

14:34.504 --> 14:37.487
♪Entwined worries linger♪

14:38.696 --> 14:41.467
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

14:43.368 --> 14:49.281
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

14:51.078 --> 14:54.138
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

14:55.304 --> 14:58.756
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

14:59.752 --> 15:05.278
♪Until the world's end♪

15:07.688 --> 15:11.484
♪If I could♪

15:12.072 --> 15:14.888
♪Keep loving you♪

15:15.912 --> 15:18.312
♪Hearing two hearts♪

15:18.312 --> 15:23.228
♪Beating together♪

15:24.200 --> 15:28.064
♪If I could♪

15:28.064 --> 15:31.304
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

15:33.904 --> 15:36.144
(Will the wonton work?)

15:39.983 --> 15:40.623
Lin Huan'er.

15:41.863 --> 15:42.463
Mr. Gao.

15:49.463 --> 15:50.544
Can I drive you home?

15:58.463 --> 15:59.703
It smells so good.

16:00.664 --> 16:02.184
You can cook Western food?

16:03.064 --> 16:03.983
I know you like it.

16:03.983 --> 16:06.103
So I tried learning it.

16:06.944 --> 16:08.304
It might not look good.

16:08.304 --> 16:09.424
I hope you'll like it.

16:09.823 --> 16:10.503
Let me try.

16:18.024 --> 16:19.463
Delicious.

16:25.544 --> 16:26.304
What's wrong?

16:28.784 --> 16:31.304
Nothing. I'm just a bit touched.

16:32.184 --> 16:33.343
I feel really happy.

16:33.703 --> 16:34.703
It feels unreal.

16:38.904 --> 16:39.703
How about this?

16:40.664 --> 16:44.103
From now on, whatever you like,

16:44.544 --> 16:46.904
I'll do my best to make it happen.

16:47.463 --> 16:48.623
I promise.

16:52.784 --> 16:53.743
Keep your word.

16:54.743 --> 16:55.544
Absolutely.

17:04.783 --> 17:05.463
Let's eat.

17:08.263 --> 17:09.503
Let me try this.

17:10.703 --> 17:13.983
You came to my place
just to cook for me?

17:15.463 --> 17:17.384
I thought
you were on the night shift today.

17:19.584 --> 17:20.263
Mengmeng.

17:21.384 --> 17:24.824
Actually, there's something
I wanted to discuss with you.

17:27.543 --> 17:28.223
Go ahead.

17:34.023 --> 17:35.703
I want to be a detective again.

17:40.864 --> 17:41.664
As you know,

17:41.664 --> 17:46.063
I've been hesitant because of my mom.

17:46.303 --> 17:47.584
I've given it up for so long.

17:49.743 --> 17:52.184
But I keep thinking about
what you said that night.

17:54.023 --> 17:56.664
I think you were right.

17:57.384 --> 18:00.263
It's rare to have a dream in one's life.

18:01.664 --> 18:02.743
I shouldn't give up.

18:04.703 --> 18:05.864
I don't want to either.

18:08.384 --> 18:09.303
I support you.

18:11.703 --> 18:12.664
You support me?

18:16.783 --> 18:20.864
Because I know
how happy it feels to achieve a dream.

18:22.783 --> 18:24.463
I want you to be happy too.

18:29.063 --> 18:30.983
But you must promise something first.

18:32.184 --> 18:33.184
Protect yourself.

18:33.344 --> 18:34.184
Don't get hurt.

18:57.063 --> 18:59.303
What should I try next?

18:59.983 --> 19:01.344
The super shrimp.

19:02.303 --> 19:03.223
You eat too.

19:06.424 --> 19:07.104
Chef.

19:09.503 --> 19:10.543
So delicious.

19:16.584 --> 19:18.584
What was the date?

19:20.263 --> 19:20.944
Right.

19:22.463 --> 19:23.503
(City Voice)
(Dear listeners,)

19:23.824 --> 19:25.664
(welcome to City Voice.)

19:25.944 --> 19:27.543
(Another beautiful afternoon.)

19:27.904 --> 19:30.864
(Let's see
who our first song requester is)

19:31.023 --> 19:32.424
(and what he wants to say.)

19:33.944 --> 19:34.743
(Hello.)

19:35.703 --> 19:39.424
(I'd like to request a song,
Moon Trouble.)

19:40.184 --> 19:40.824
(Okay.)

19:41.063 --> 19:43.824
(Who would you like
to dedicate this song to, sir?)

19:46.344 --> 19:47.344
It's for...

19:49.503 --> 19:51.184
It's for a woman I hate very much.

19:52.463 --> 19:53.584
(Her name is Lin Huan'er.)

19:55.144 --> 19:57.384
(Sir, did you have a fight
with your girlfriend?)

19:57.624 --> 19:59.783
(Do you need our show to help you?)

20:02.503 --> 20:03.824
(You can't help me.)

20:05.263 --> 20:06.248
(Because she...)

20:07.528 --> 20:08.520
(She's bad.)

20:11.463 --> 20:14.543
She took my heart away

20:16.384 --> 20:18.144
but won't give me hers in return.

20:19.864 --> 20:21.424
(Oh, so it's unrequited love.)

20:21.824 --> 20:23.983
(Seems it's not the moon's fault.)

20:24.063 --> 20:26.063
(It's the girl you love who hurts you.)

20:27.424 --> 20:31.463
Sometimes,
I really wish I'd never met her.

20:33.783 --> 20:35.543
Then, I wouldn't be in such a mess.

20:37.824 --> 20:38.703
(I hate her.)

20:40.144 --> 20:41.864
(I hate
that she hides everything from me.)

20:44.223 --> 20:48.384
And I hate myself even more
for not daring to confront her.

20:53.543 --> 20:54.864
(But I want to tell her)

20:55.743 --> 20:58.384
I-I don't hate her.

20:59.263 --> 21:00.424
I don't dislike her either.

21:01.263 --> 21:02.624
(I still have feelings for her.)

21:07.263 --> 21:08.503
But I'm just jealous.

21:10.703 --> 21:13.944
Yes, I'm jealous.

21:18.664 --> 21:19.303
(Okay.)

21:19.743 --> 21:22.983
(Let's listen to the song,
Moon Trouble.)

21:23.463 --> 21:26.023
(We hope the lady this gentleman likes)

21:26.303 --> 21:28.503
(can hear his heart.)

21:37.448 --> 21:40.431
♪Entwined worries linger♪

21:41.640 --> 21:44.411
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

21:46.312 --> 21:52.225
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

21:55.144 --> 21:55.824
Huan'er.

21:57.184 --> 21:58.303
Why are you crying?

22:00.104 --> 22:00.944
Why?

22:01.944 --> 22:05.303
This song is touching.

22:05.303 --> 22:07.424
I'm actually a little moved.

22:09.104 --> 22:10.344
There's no music playing.

22:10.503 --> 22:11.463
Are you playing it?

22:14.904 --> 22:15.783
Is there no song?

22:16.424 --> 22:18.664
No, there's no sound at all.

22:19.303 --> 22:20.344
It's playing right now.

22:20.344 --> 22:21.303
(City Voice)
Can't you hear it?

22:22.104 --> 22:22.864
No.

22:27.944 --> 22:29.584
It's okay. Just leave me alone.

22:31.023 --> 22:32.503
I'm going to sleep.

22:35.304 --> 22:42.629
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

22:47.223 --> 22:49.384
(Turns out nobody else knows)

22:49.703 --> 22:52.664
(what happened between us except me.)

23:04.463 --> 23:07.144
(Dear listeners, welcome to City Voice.)

23:07.503 --> 23:09.263
(Beautiful afternoon.)

23:09.263 --> 23:11.463
(You must all be in a good mood, right?)

23:12.023 --> 23:15.063
(Now, let's have the first person
to request a song today)

23:15.063 --> 23:16.223
(and listen to them.)

23:17.223 --> 23:17.983
(Hello?)

23:18.743 --> 23:19.664
(Hello?)

23:20.223 --> 23:21.104
(What's your name?)

23:21.824 --> 23:22.864
(My name is Lin Huan'er.)

23:23.503 --> 23:24.783
(I'd like to request a song)

23:25.303 --> 23:27.184
(for an important friend of mine.)

23:27.783 --> 23:29.743
(I think he's probably
listening right now.)

23:30.664 --> 23:32.864
(Okay, what would you
like to say to him?)

23:33.864 --> 23:34.983
(I want to tell him)

23:36.223 --> 23:39.584
(that I've heard you on the radio.)

23:41.743 --> 23:44.743
(We've been through a lot together.)

23:45.624 --> 23:47.223
(And we have many wonderful memories.)

23:48.703 --> 23:50.543
(Though you don't
remember any of it now,)

23:52.424 --> 23:53.384
(it's okay.)

23:54.063 --> 23:55.144
(From now on,)

23:55.624 --> 23:57.263
(I'll always be with you)

23:57.864 --> 23:58.824
(until you remember.)

23:59.944 --> 24:00.584
(Okay.)

24:00.584 --> 24:03.743
(Let's all listen to the song,
Love Is Just One Word.)

24:27.664 --> 24:30.624
(We've been through a lot together.)

24:31.503 --> 24:33.104
(And we have many wonderful memories.)

24:34.144 --> 24:35.864
(Though you don't
remember any of it now,)

24:37.063 --> 24:38.063
(it's okay.)

24:38.703 --> 24:39.783
(From now on,)

24:40.303 --> 24:41.783
(I'll always be with you)

24:42.584 --> 24:43.703
(until you remember.)

26:28.624 --> 26:29.463
Mr. Gao.

26:31.384 --> 26:33.384
Regarding the Gen 2 of the Her Series,

26:33.384 --> 26:34.303
how is it going?

26:34.783 --> 26:37.904
Dr. Wei is currently
upgrading the raw materials.

26:38.104 --> 26:39.543
Next week, it should be...

26:46.624 --> 26:48.983
Where did you get this doll?

26:51.584 --> 26:53.263
Do you have one similar to this?

26:54.463 --> 26:55.023
Yes.

26:56.824 --> 26:58.864
Do you have any memories of this doll?

27:02.223 --> 27:02.983
Hold on a second.

27:03.223 --> 27:04.344
I'll go get you something.

27:06.536 --> 27:10.248
♪I boarded a rickety time machine♪

27:10.248 --> 27:13.584
♪My heart is pounding♪

27:13.584 --> 27:14.624
Look at these photos.

27:14.864 --> 27:15.983
Can you think of anything?

27:17.577 --> 27:21.960
♪In memories, the breeze is soft♪

27:21.960 --> 27:26.056
♪Your smile is shimmering like stars♪

27:26.056 --> 27:32.001
♪Lighting up my lonely corner♪

28:01.944 --> 28:03.184
Why are you showing me scenery?

28:07.263 --> 28:08.624
Is scenery all you can see?

28:14.983 --> 28:15.783
What about Lvcheng?

28:16.303 --> 28:17.023
Lvcheng?

28:18.344 --> 28:19.783
Lvcheng has dealers there.

28:21.263 --> 28:21.783
Then...

28:23.144 --> 28:25.344
You bought 33 air cans, right?

28:25.624 --> 28:26.424
How do you know?

28:26.584 --> 28:28.184
Can you remember why you bought them?

28:29.503 --> 28:30.664
In Italy, I bought them

28:30.944 --> 28:32.104
because they seemed fun.

28:32.664 --> 28:33.743
What are you trying to say?

28:41.184 --> 28:41.783
Forget it.

28:43.983 --> 28:44.904
Mr. Gao, I have to go.

28:45.783 --> 28:46.384
Wait.

29:11.743 --> 29:13.904
It's a shame
Huan'er went to Lvcheng on business.

29:14.104 --> 29:15.864
Otherwise,
we could have hung out together.

29:17.144 --> 29:18.703
I wonder if she's feeling better.

29:20.023 --> 29:20.783
What's wrong?

29:21.584 --> 29:24.463
Ever since New Year's Eve,
I've felt something was off with her.

29:24.983 --> 29:26.463
But when I asked her,

29:26.983 --> 29:28.184
she always said she was fine.

29:29.184 --> 29:30.424
She should be fine, right?

29:32.303 --> 29:34.904
Don't you think
Huan'er has become much more mature?

29:35.463 --> 29:38.624
It seems like after leaving Xiaojue,
she's become more and more independent.

29:39.263 --> 29:40.983
Huan'er was always independent.

29:40.983 --> 29:42.664
What does Ou Xiaojue have to do with it?

29:42.664 --> 29:44.384
True. I'm bad with words.

29:45.944 --> 29:47.983
Anyway, let's have fun today.

29:49.543 --> 29:50.144
Mengmeng.

29:52.063 --> 29:55.023
I want to take you somewhere.

29:55.463 --> 29:56.184
Okay.

29:56.783 --> 29:58.184
But close your eyes now.

30:02.263 --> 30:02.983
Let's go.

30:07.104 --> 30:07.703
Careful.

30:12.344 --> 30:13.384
Can I open my eyes now?

30:14.743 --> 30:15.543
Just a moment.

30:15.743 --> 30:17.063
I'll tell you when to open them.

30:25.104 --> 30:26.584
Can I open my eyes now?

30:27.263 --> 30:28.303
Wait a little longer.

30:31.944 --> 30:32.743
Tiehan.

30:34.104 --> 30:35.463
Okay, open your eyes.

30:42.344 --> 30:44.424
(Love You)

30:52.520 --> 30:55.624
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

30:58.747 --> 31:01.704
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

31:04.840 --> 31:07.144
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

31:07.144 --> 31:10.280
(After spending the first birthday
with you, I finally dared to get close)

31:10.280 --> 31:15.336
♪I've become the center of the story♪

31:16.232 --> 31:20.602
♪I must escape this dream♪

31:22.184 --> 31:26.784
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

31:27.752 --> 31:31.656
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot,
a fake world♪

31:31.976 --> 31:34.152
♪A fake world♪

31:34.856 --> 31:39.848
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

31:41.608 --> 31:44.712
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

31:47.835 --> 31:50.792
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

31:53.928 --> 31:57.448
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

31:59.368 --> 32:04.424
♪I've become the center of the story♪

32:05.320 --> 32:10.568
♪I must escape this dream♪

32:11.272 --> 32:16.840
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

32:16.840 --> 32:20.744
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot,
a fake world♪

32:22.223 --> 32:22.904
Mengmeng.

32:25.023 --> 32:29.184
We've missed each other for a long time.

32:30.543 --> 32:36.824
But thankfully, in the end,
we are the ones who stand by each other.

32:41.463 --> 32:46.344
Every time before,
it was you who bravely found me.

32:47.743 --> 32:49.104
This time, I want to be brave too.

33:08.223 --> 33:08.904
Mengmeng.

33:12.543 --> 33:13.703
Will you marry me?

33:22.703 --> 33:23.424
I do.

34:19.904 --> 34:21.904
Look at that bridge over there,
it's so beautiful.

34:24.224 --> 34:25.143
This is pretty too.

34:25.928 --> 34:26.952
But not as pretty as you.

34:32.503 --> 34:33.063
Huan'er.

34:43.384 --> 34:45.063
Such beautiful fireworks!

34:51.543 --> 34:52.063
Huan'er.

34:52.296 --> 34:52.583
You...

34:52.583 --> 34:53.864
Darling, will you marry me?

34:54.023 --> 34:56.543
- Say yes!
- Say yes!

34:56.543 --> 34:58.864
- Say yes!
- Say yes!

34:58.864 --> 34:59.864
I do.

34:59.864 --> 35:00.864
- Say yes!
- Say yes!

35:05.264 --> 35:07.264
This is a good place for confessions.

35:09.384 --> 35:11.623
I once saw someone confessing here.

35:13.623 --> 35:14.904
So, did they succeed?

35:18.583 --> 35:19.583
One couple succeeded.

35:20.344 --> 35:21.663
But another couple gave up

35:23.023 --> 35:26.103
due to some unexpected reasons.

35:27.063 --> 35:28.503
How could they just give up?

35:29.384 --> 35:31.063
Maybe that's how the story is written.

35:31.824 --> 35:34.904
There are reasons you have to give up.

35:36.983 --> 35:38.183
Mr. Gao,

35:38.463 --> 35:41.824
for a confession,
is it about the ritual or timing?

35:43.944 --> 35:44.623
Both matters.

35:46.543 --> 35:47.904
I think timing is more important.

35:49.264 --> 35:52.543
Sometimes, you've prepared everything.

35:52.904 --> 35:54.143
The ritual is in place,

35:54.824 --> 35:56.183
but the timing is gone.

35:58.704 --> 35:59.384
Why is that?

36:00.744 --> 36:03.944
Two people in love
won't miss their chance.

36:04.983 --> 36:06.143
Even if they miss it,

36:06.463 --> 36:08.023
they'll find it eventually.

36:13.623 --> 36:14.904
I hope so.

36:18.904 --> 36:19.583
Let's go.

36:39.704 --> 36:40.424
What's wrong?

36:47.713 --> 36:50.696
♪Entwined worries linger♪

36:51.905 --> 36:54.676
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

36:56.577 --> 37:02.490
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

37:04.287 --> 37:07.347
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

37:08.513 --> 37:11.965
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

37:12.961 --> 37:18.487
♪Until the world's end♪

37:20.897 --> 37:24.693
♪If I could♪

37:25.281 --> 37:28.097
♪Keep loving you♪

37:29.121 --> 37:31.521
♪Hearing two hearts♪

37:31.521 --> 37:36.437
♪Beating together♪

37:37.409 --> 37:41.273
♪If I could♪

37:41.273 --> 37:44.513
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

37:45.569 --> 37:52.894
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

